      {
        "text": "With large majorities, governing becomes more difficult.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "After 9/11, there was immediate collective action focused on protecting the country and supporting troops.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The current political climate rewards extreme or harsh voices due to internet culture, clickbait, and social media.",
        "confidence": 0.93
