    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84091.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "I would be remiss to have you here and not ask you the following question. You, of course, were President Trump's vice president for four years. You made news earlier this year when you announced that you would not be supporting President Trump in this year's election. He will be the Republican nominee. Can you explain your decision on that?",
