        "text": "You served as President Trump's vice president for four years.",
        "confidence": 0.99
      },
      {
        "text": "I would be remiss if I did not ask you the following question.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "You made news earlier this year by announcing you would not support President Trump in this year's election.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "President Trump will be the Republican nominee.",
