        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The fact that someone was Vice President implies they had significant influence over policy and could reasonably be expected to comment on it.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Public figures should provide explanations for their political choices.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Announcing non-support for a candidate creates a legitimate basis for media inquiry.",
